## An order-2x2 NuPatch (nu=nv=2, knots [0 0 1 1] on both axes) -- a
## clamped degree-1 B-spline, mathematically bilinear interpolation of its
## four control points, the same as patch_bilinear_twin.rib's "Patch
## bilinear" over the same points in the same order. Same frame, lighting
## and "plastic" surface as that twin; the two images are compared
## pixel by pixel.
##
## A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
## desync convention."
Display "nupatch_bilinear.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [0.8] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [2 2 -3] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 2
Surface "plastic" "Ka" [0.2] "Kd" [0.7] "Ks" [0.6] "roughness" [0.08]
	"specularcolor" [1 1 1]
NuPatch 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1
	"P" [-0.5 -0.5 0   0.5 -0.4 0.2   -0.4 0.5 -0.1   0.5 0.5 0.3]
AttributeBegin
	Translate 1.5 0 0
	Sphere 0.3 -0.3 0.3 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
